(5676055, 825762, 27161, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this photo, it was on my blackberry and I thought wow, but then I came home to vote on my computer and saw the noise. :(  If I''m understanding your post-processing correctly you brightened the right side to see the skull and more of the flame, but it looks really bad with all of the noise.  It would have looked so good if you left it black... Yeah, I looked at it again on my blackberry and it looks pretty good.  I wonder if you can see the noise or if your monitor is too dark.</td>', 'When I first saw this photo, it was on my blackberry and I thought wow, but then I came home to vote on my computer and saw the noise. :(  If I''m understanding your post-processing correctly you brightened the right side to see the skull and more of the flame, but it looks really bad with all of the noise.  It would have looked so good if you left it black... Yeah, I looked at it again on my blackberry and it looks pretty good.  I wonder if you can see the noise or if your monitor is too dark.', '2009-10-05 19:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
