(5683761, 825383, 110294, '<td valign="top">I like the dancing sparkles of this image, kind of mysterious, If it were not in this challenge, I would wonder what it is, Makes the eye keep moving around to find a point of reference. Keep up the great work..</td>', 'I like the dancing sparkles of this image, kind of mysterious, If it were not in this challenge, I would wonder what it is, Makes the eye keep moving around to find a point of reference. Keep up the great work..', '2009-10-11 20:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
