(5683842, 825533, 83313, '<td valign="top">Always one in the challenge who likes to play with flashlights and long exposures. Looks pretty cool, I must admit.</td>', 'Always one in the challenge who likes to play with flashlights and long exposures. Looks pretty cool, I must admit.', '2009-10-11 22:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
