(5683844, 825448, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think you are going to get creamed for not actually having fire in the shot. Where there''s smoke, there''s fire, I suppose?</td>', 'I think you are going to get creamed for not actually having fire in the shot. Where there''s smoke, there''s fire, I suppose?', '2009-10-11 22:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
