(5683926, 825777, 69668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> One of the most overspoofed ad campaigns ever. "Flick my Bic" was viral marketing before the term was even coined. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I know.....and I agree!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: One of the most overspoofed ad campaigns ever. "Flick my Bic" was viral marketing before the term was even coined.   I know.....and I agree!!!', '2009-10-12 01:02:15.000000', NULL, 0);
