(5687928, 825618, 59415, '<td valign="top">He needs to put some pants on when he plays with fire.</td>', 'He needs to put some pants on when he plays with fire.', '2009-10-14 23:57:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5688005, 825446, 39430, '<td valign="top">Well, nobody else has mentioned it, so I think I have to...he''s playing the guitar backwards.  :(  OK, maybe one in 10,000 guitars is strung left handed, but they are very rare.  Maybe you flipped the image?  Most people probably don''t care, but to a guitar player, it''s about as important as not flipping writing.<br/> <br/>As a teenager, I had a poster of a guy playing sax, but obviously neither the model or the photographer knew anything about saxophones, because the moutpiece was on upside down.  :)<br/></td>', 'Well, nobody else has mentioned it, so I think I have to...he''s playing the guitar backwards.  :(  OK, maybe one in 10,000 guitars is strung left handed, but they are very rare.  Maybe you flipped the image?  Most people probably don''t care, but to a guitar player, it''s about as important as not flipping writing. As a teenager, I had a poster of a guy playing sax, but obviously neither the model or the photographer knew anything about saxophones, because the moutpiece was on upside down.  :)', '2009-10-15 02:31:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5688770, 825618, 98339, '<td valign="top">Juliet...what a fabulous picture!!!  Congrats on your ribbon...sorry I''m late with this...just got back into town and catching up...</td>', 'Juliet...what a fabulous picture!!!  Congrats on your ribbon...sorry I''m late with this...just got back into town and catching up...', '2009-10-15 21:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5689926, 825773, 31637, '<td valign="top">The good ol'' subatomic cascade effect:)</td>', 'The good ol'' subatomic cascade effect:)', '2009-10-16 19:02:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5690332, 825654, 39850, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/39850/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_809051.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/39850/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_809051.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/39850/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_809051.jpg"/> <br/> <br/><u>Critique Club Critique</u> <br/> <br/><b>First Impressions</b> <br/>Seems to meet the Challenge.  Quite good symmetry.  Perhaps could have been enhanced by some cloning out of minor issues here and there.<br/> <br/><b>Photograph Information, Technicals &amp; Composition Review</b> <br/>A slighty deeper DOF would have allowed the flames (fire) to become more apparent.  <br/> <br/>Compositionally, don''t mind the front on aspect, but perhaps a slightly tighter crop would have evoked a feeling of being ''in front of'' this fire more.  But depends what you were aiming for.<br/> <br/><b>Comments, Score &amp; Placement Review</b> <br/>61/96 and a score of 5.26 is a fairly good score for an entry that ended up in the bottom third.<br/> <br/>Your commenters don''t really give much indication of what they felt could have improved the image, save for perhaps the first comment.<br/> <br/><b>Summary</b> <br/>I wonder about a more ''level'' point of view/perspective, whether this may have given the image an edge.  That coupled with the deeper depth of field, as mentioned above, would likely have produced a stronger image for this Challenge.<br/> <br/><i>edit: typo</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-10-17 07:50:53.</i></td>', '  Critique Club Critique  First Impressions Seems to meet the Challenge.  Quite good symmetry.  Perhaps could have been enhanced by some cloning out of minor issues here and there. Photograph Information, Technicals & Composition Review A slighty deeper DOF would have allowed the flames (fire) to become more apparent.   Compositionally, don''t mind the front on aspect, but perhaps a slightly tighter crop would have evoked a feeling of being ''in front of'' this fire more.  But depends what you were aiming for. Comments, Score & Placement Review 61/96 and a score of 5.26 is a fairly good score for an entry that ended up in the bottom third. Your commenters don''t really give much indication of what they felt could have improved the image, save for perhaps the first comment. Summary I wonder about a more ''level'' point of view/perspective, whether this may have given the image an edge.  That coupled with the deeper depth of field, as mentioned above, would likely have produced a stronger image for this Challenge. edit: typo', '2009-10-17 08:40:59.000000', '2009-10-17 08:50:53.000000', 0),
(5690816, 825761, 99710, '<td valign="top">great work, congratulations</td>', 'great work, congratulations', '2009-10-17 22:53:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5690857, 825721, 83845, '<td valign="top">Very nice first submission!  Mine was a 4.1, lol.</td>', 'Very nice first submission!  Mine was a 4.1, lol.', '2009-10-18 00:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5691330, 825761, 66384, '<td valign="top">Andres, it was wonderful meeting you today, and since my computer is broken, I didn''t even realize you had just won a blue ribbon. I wish I had known so I could have congratulated you in person. This looks like a great photo on my iPhone. I can''t wait til I can see it full sized.</td>', 'Andres, it was wonderful meeting you today, and since my computer is broken, I didn''t even realize you had just won a blue ribbon. I wish I had known so I could have congratulated you in person. This looks like a great photo on my iPhone. I can''t wait til I can see it full sized.', '2009-10-18 16:10:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5705958, 825761, 20530, '<td valign="top">This is so great! Brings back memories of so many of my own camping trips. Love this image.</td>', 'This is so great! Brings back memories of so many of my own camping trips. Love this image.', '2009-10-29 19:24:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5706361, 825761, 80278, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image on all levels, technically, emotionally, and artistically. Two subtle elements of surrealism add to the magic of the moment: the PS tweaks to the lighting, and the wide-angle distortion which makes even the trees bend toward the compelling glow of the fire. Congratulations, Andres!</td>', 'Wonderful image on all levels, technically, emotionally, and artistically. Two subtle elements of surrealism add to the magic of the moment: the PS tweaks to the lighting, and the wide-angle distortion which makes even the trees bend toward the compelling glow of the fire. Congratulations, Andres!', '2009-10-30 08:34:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5710327, 825631, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is cute :)  I love the whole tippy-toe-I-can-reach-the-button moment.</td>', 'This is cute :)  I love the whole tippy-toe-I-can-reach-the-button moment.', '2009-11-02 08:41:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5749973, 825762, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great capture...great movie!  What noise?</td>', 'Great capture...great movie!  What noise?', '2009-12-02 09:14:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5896156, 825710, 28710, '<td valign="top">I agree with the others, the pic itself looks pretty cool with nice use of grain, but the borders gotta go.<br/> <br/>I don''t get ''waiting'' either.</td>', 'I agree with the others, the pic itself looks pretty cool with nice use of grain, but the borders gotta go. I don''t get ''waiting'' either.', '2010-03-09 09:16:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5998435, 825725, 63398, '<td valign="top">This is terrific! I dunno why it didn''t do better. I''d have given it a 6 at least.</td>', 'This is terrific! I dunno why it didn''t do better. I''d have given it a 6 at least.', '2010-05-09 17:29:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6182009, 825725, 64568, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea and great execution. Shoudl have scored a lot higher IMO.</td>', 'Very clever idea and great execution. Shoudl have scored a lot higher IMO.', '2010-10-05 16:51:56.000000', NULL, 0);
